# Problem Statement 5: Content-Based Movie Recommendation System

## Objective
Build and deploy a content-based recommendation system that suggests the most relevant movies based on user preferences and textual metadata similarities.

## Domain
Data Science, Natural Language Processing (NLP), and Machine Learning.

## Key Requirements
1. Ingest and preprocess movie metadata (genres, keywords, taglines, directors, cast, and overview synopses).
2. Clean text, handle missing values, and construct combined feature representations.
3. Apply Term Frequency-Inverse Document Frequency (TF-IDF) vectorization to capture word importance.
4. Calculate pairwise Cosine Similarity scores between movies.
5. Provide fuzzy title matching to handle user typos and partial title inputs.
6. Return ranked movie recommendations with match confidence and rich metadata.
